  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Fill a cocktail shaker with ice cubes. Pour in chocolate and cherry vodkas, grenadine, crème de cacao, half-and-half, and chocolate syrup. Cover and shake until the outside of the shaker has frosted. Strain into a chilled martini glass, garnish with maraschino cherry and chocolate kiss, and serve.",
